cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Evgeny's Theorem: Spectral-Moment Identities on the Sierpiński Gasket"
authors:
  - family-names: Zaprudnov
    given-names: Evgeny
repository-code: "https://github.com/RFT-SIRM/Evgeny-Theorem"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean formalization and reproducible exact computations for SU(2)-valued
  operators on Sierpiński-gasket refinements. The project includes the exact
  fourth-moment identity and an all-angle sixth-moment recurrence with an
  exact symbolic finite-level base-transition certificate; higher moments
  remain under study.
